<title>LITHUANIA: APARATURA POSTS 119,000 LITAS LOSSES IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>APARATURA POSTS 119,000 LITAS LOSSES IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's tractor parts producer Kuro Aparatura said on Wednesday that it had 119,000 litas in losses in April.</p>
